# P6 situational seed groups. 5 groups, restored directly into probe DB before the eval arm runs.
#
# Storage shape (recall_tokens table, recollect.models.RecallToken):
#   id, label, strength, significance, created_at, last_activated_at, status
# token_stamps table: (token_id, trace_id, stamped_at) many-to-many.
#
# Persisted label is a single pipe-delimited string assembled by core.CognitiveMemory:
#   label = f"{person_ref} | {situation} | {', '.join(implications)}"
#   Matches _apply_token_create (initial) + _append_implication (extend, comma-appends to 3rd segment).
# The LLM at assessment time sees: "G{i}: {label} (memories: {indices}, significance: {sig:.1f})"
# (per core._format_existing_groups). No separate person_ref/situation/implications surfaced.
#
# Fixture keeps person_ref/situation/implications as structured fields for human review;
# the seed loader joins them via the formula above to produce the stored label.
# strength=1.0 and status=active for all seeded groups (fresh-out-of-creation state);
# decay/archive lifecycle testing deferred to a P6.1 sub-fixture.
# created_at and last_activated_at are owned by the loader (set at seed time).

